-2.  $B$: A bounding box (square in $\mathbb{R}^2$, cube in $\mathbb{R}^3$) containing the implicit manifold $S = F^{-1}(0)$.
-3.  $F$ must have $0$ as a regular value, meaning $\nabla F$ is non-zero at every point on $S$ [S1].
